cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use infy in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "infy: a zero-dependency, SIMD-accelerated LLM framework with in-process governance"
abstract: >-
  infy is a from-scratch Python runtime for LLM applications and agentic systems with a
  zero-dependency core, a Rust SIMD extension for hot paths, a Pregel-style stateful graph
  executor, and an optional in-process governance layer (policy, risk, approval, tamper-evident
  audit).
type: software
authors:
